dcterms:hasPart a owl:AnnotationProperty.
dcterms:isPartOf a owl:AnnotationProperty.
dqm:DataQualityScore a owl:Class;
                     owl:equivalentClass <http://www.data-knowledge.org/dk/KpiMeasurement>.
dqm:DataRequirement a owl:Class;
                    owl:equivalentClass <http://www.data-knowledge.org/dk/BusinessRule>.
qb:DataSet a owl:Class;
           owl:equivalentClass <http://www.data-knowledge.org/dk/DataAsset>.
lifecycle:Lifecycle a owl:Class.
lifecycle:Lifecyle a owl:Class.
